WEBVTT

00:00:00.790 --> 00:00:03.880
I'm looking forward to 
seeing the siblings reunited.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:09.530
It's bound to be a touching spectacle!

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:12.990
Right. Everything's unfolding 
according to plan.

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:14.820
Asahi!

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:16.970
Asahi?!

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:35.160
Look at you, all desperate...

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:12.920
<b>Book 1: The Wilderness of Love & Sorrow</b>

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:20.400
To save a stranger with no blood relation,

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:23.370
<b>Episode 4: Confidential Case File 099, Kuchinawa</b>

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:23.390
she's willing to submit to the man 
she wants vengeance against.

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:27.580
There are very few people like that.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.910
I assure you, she's one of them.

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:33.200
Then we're a bit alike.

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:36.380
There's a good chance she'll
 be interrupted, though.

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:38.230
Jin Kuzuhara...

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:41.220
I have very little in common with him.

00:02:55.130 --> 00:02:57.780
None of this was authorized.

00:02:58.500 --> 00:02:59.570
What are you doing here?

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:02.920
Hanakaze was sent to collect you,

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:05.200
noticed something was off, and informed me.

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:08.910
If you know what happened, 
then let me go, please.

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.210
I can't do that.

00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:14.730
Do you even realize why 
that girl was kidnapped?

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:19.020
Tsukishiro was the one who told 
Janome about your hideout,

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:24.160
as well as the one who killed 
the cleaner. I've verified it.

00:03:25.030 --> 00:03:28.660
You think I'm going to let you 
go alone, knowing it's a trap?

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:32.750
I'm going to rescue Asahi 
and get my revenge.

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:34.730
You can't.

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:36.530
You need to make a decision.

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:38.950
Do you want vengeance 
for your family, your clan?

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:40.990
Or to save the girl you rescued?

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:44.700
If you want revenge, I'll help.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:49.190
The minute the girl's life becomes 
a priority, you don't stand a chance.

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:51.930
It'd be tantamount to giving 
Janome your blood.

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:55.210
I'd be better off killing you right now.

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:01.320
What's wrong? Not going to draw?

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:10.090
You can't even steel yourself to kill me.

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:12.550
What were you going to do 
in a hostage situation?

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:50.640
Time to abscond with the princess...

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:55.980
And offer her up to the heretic.

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:04.860
You should really think hard about what 
to do with the rest of your life.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:26.720
Sawa! What're you doing?

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:29.700
Not telling!

00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:39.230
The seeds are gonna get eaten...

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:41.490
It's fine. We have enough to share.

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:45.310
The birds are our friends.

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:57.790
I don't have a friend...

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:02.840
Well, it's going to be a lifetime friendship, 
so the birds want to choose carefully.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:05.630
You think I'll get one?

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:11.800
You're sweet, Sawa. I know you'll be fine.

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:15.340
When the time comes, 
you'll be chosen, too.

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:18.760
You just have to wait.

00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:23.740
Takeru, Sawa, it's time for lunch.

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:25.020
Coming!

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:29.670
What were you two talking about?

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:30.880
It's a secret!

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:45.990
Nana...

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:50.080
Where are we?

00:06:57.260 --> 00:06:59.310
Janome! Are you out there?!

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:40.060
Janome!

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:51.070
Release Asahi!

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:56.520
"I could not speak, and my eyes failed."

00:07:56.900 --> 00:08:00.330
"I was neither living nor dead,

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:04.110
and I knew nothing, looking into 
the heart of light, the silence."

00:08:04.110 --> 00:08:07.200
“Desolate and empty is the sea."

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:08.590
Spare me!

00:08:08.940 --> 00:08:12.260
From <i>The Burial of the Dead, 
</i>found in <i>The Waste Land.</i>

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:17.620
An Englishman composed it, but I find it 
appropriate for the state of this country.

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:19.760
Stop spouting nonsense!

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:26.550
Asahi-kun's fine, by the way.

00:08:26.550 --> 00:08:29.110
As long as you don't resist, 
she'll stay that way.

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:34.830
I wish you wouldn't be so sore about this.

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:41.370
I mean, thanks to me, the two of 
you get to stay together forever...

00:08:41.850 --> 00:08:43.840
Down here in this dark hole.

00:09:01.300 --> 00:09:04.850
We have accommodations 
for your old friend, as well.

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:07.480
Nana...

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:27.650
You weren't able to get revenge 
or rescue Asahi-kun.

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:30.660
You're at a total loss 
right now, aren't you?

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:32.150
Why did you betray us?

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:35.650
For the sake of true freedom.

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:39.680
All the art pieces in this 
room are reproductions.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:42.560
Much like how everything 
about this country is a lie.

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:46.110
I couldn't care less.

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:49.690
You killed my father! My mother! My brother!

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:51.990
That's the only truth that matters!

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:56.200
My desire is to transform this 
wasteland of lies into its true form...

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:57.860
With your help.

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:10.830
This is much better quality...

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:13.850
I feel guilty, mind you.

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:17.060
Were it not for the hypocrites that traded 
the country's welfare for their own,

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:19.300
it wouldn't have come to this.

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:24.100
And I sincerely regret my service to them, 
even if it was only temporary.

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:28.040
With your blood, I will be able 
to reinvigorate the nation.

00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:32.610
I only ask that you live here, 
with the girl, until my task is complete.

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:36.860
Tsukishiro-kun made it sound as if 
that's what she wants, as well.

00:10:37.230 --> 00:10:39.890
Asahi doesn't want to be kept like a pet!

00:10:39.890 --> 00:10:42.380
What exactly were you doing with her, then?

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:45.210
Weren't <i>you</i> keeping her?

00:10:45.610 --> 00:10:47.920
Not that it matters, really.

00:10:47.920 --> 00:10:51.630
For now, you just need to make 
sure nothing happens to her.

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:55.960
She won't be able to get revenge 
on you if she dies, will she?

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:03.170
My work is still incomplete...

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:09.770
But with enough blood to work from, 
I should be able to complete the new formula.

00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:20.300
In a few years, I'll be able to 
replicate the blue blood perfectly,

00:11:20.300 --> 00:11:22.030
and you'll be free to go.

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:25.770
The moment you let me loose 
will be the moment you die!

00:11:25.770 --> 00:11:29.750
It doesn't matter if it's in ten years 
or twenty! I will kill you!

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:31.660
Suit yourself.

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:37.500
I don't really care what happens after 
I've saved this country, with your help.

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:41.810
I will never help a ruthless monster like you!

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:49.390
You seem to misunderstand me. 
I have a great respect for your clan.

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:51.770
I might go so far as to say I worship them.

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:53.780
Then why kill them?

00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:55.610
That's where you're mistaken.

00:11:57.570 --> 00:12:02.320
All I am doing is bringing the justice 
you all sought into reality...

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:06.580
And sadly, he can no longer hear 
the melody of righteousness.

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:07.940
From now on...

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:13.420
It will be your turn.

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:28.560
There is such pure strength in your cry.

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:45.890
I've empowered these snakes 
with the essence of the blue blood.

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:50.150
You'll find you lack the 
capacity to kill them all.

00:12:58.360 --> 00:12:59.340
Asahi!

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:04.130
I'm curious about the mentality 
behind this irrational course of action.

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:06.290
I wanted freedom...

00:13:06.290 --> 00:13:09.900
And I wanted to relieve her 
of the heavy burden

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:12.580
that was digging into her shoulders.

00:13:13.470 --> 00:13:16.350
Do you realize how contradictory that is?

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:19.610
I guess I <i>did</i> get a bit too greedy...

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:26.700
Wait here, Asahi.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:32.690
I wanted to keep you unhurt

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:35.640
to ensure the quality of 
the blood samples, but...

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:07.160
The map says it's somewhere around here.

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:08.780
But there's not a damn thing!

00:14:10.150 --> 00:14:12.420
There has to be an entrance 
to the underground.

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:15.320
That's a coded signal...

00:14:15.320 --> 00:14:16.340
This way!

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:19.560
An old water purification plant?

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:23.040
Was the idea that we head there next?

00:14:23.990 --> 00:14:25.150
Let's move.

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:29.120
But Tsukishiro was the one 
who used coded signals like that.

00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:30.690
This could be a trap, too.

00:14:30.690 --> 00:14:32.540
We don't have any other leads.

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:35.020
We'll worry about allegiances later.

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:48.520
Janome!

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:52.070
The new formula is working 
exactly as I had calculated.

00:14:52.730 --> 00:14:53.700
Nana!

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:06.140
You, who would deny the foundation 
of what makes a man!

00:15:06.140 --> 00:15:10.320
Dwell now in the blue that surges within!

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:22.950
So that's the true power 
of the Karasumori clan?

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:28.960
I will now avenge my clan's death!

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:47.630
Not deep enough.

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:55.650
Your power manifests in a beautiful fashion,

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:58.340
but my new formula is proving 
to be more effective.

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:43.440
I would appreciate it if 
you ceased these attacks.

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:50.470
This battle really serves no purpose.

00:16:51.230 --> 00:16:54.570
How... couldn't it?!

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:57.180
My clan...

00:16:57.180 --> 00:16:59.800
Vengeance for my mother and father!

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:07.300
Revenge, is it?

00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:10.190
You and I are the same, then.

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:11.500
Shut your mouth!

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:16.510
I am nothing like you!

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:20.650
You and I are both playing the same melody.

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:22.900
How can you not see that?

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:24.320
I don't see how...

00:17:25.260 --> 00:17:26.960
And I don't care to see!

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:31.620
You'll need to be subdued, then.

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:44.290
Onii-chan?!

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:06.820
Vengeance for my clan...

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:09.900
Justice for my family...

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:13.900
I'm taking it all now!

00:18:24.030 --> 00:18:26.290
The slightest hint of pity,

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:33.680
the briefest flicker of hesitation...

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:45.860
For you... For only you...

00:18:47.840 --> 00:18:49.520
There will be absolutely none!

00:19:02.680 --> 00:19:05.480
<i>Upon fulfillment of a long-held dream</i>

00:19:05.480 --> 00:19:07.760
<i>What fills the mind?</i>

00:19:08.220 --> 00:19:11.530
<i>Is this moment truly all there is?</i>

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:18.710
Revenge, eh?

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:30.640
This isn't like you.

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:34.900
It should be obvious that you'll burn 
to death if you try to get through that!

00:19:36.970 --> 00:19:38.940
If we're lucky, she'll make her way out.

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:42.700
You know she's not normal. Besides...

00:19:43.110 --> 00:19:47.180
She was always saying she didn't care 
about dying, as long as she got revenge.

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:49.950
Onii-chan!

00:20:04.310 --> 00:20:08.040
It really was you, Sawa...

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:11.350
That's right.

00:20:12.030 --> 00:20:15.610
It's so hot... Is there a fire?

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:18.610
Onii-chan! Let's get out of here together!

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:21.530
You'll have to go on your own, Sawa...

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:24.280
No! I'm taking you with me!

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:27.440
No, I won't last much longer.

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:29.450
I can't even see.

00:20:30.130 --> 00:20:33.630
It's okay! It's all over!

00:20:33.630 --> 00:20:35.640
I killed Janome!

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:37.830
I got revenge for the others!

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:40.270
There won't be anyone else 
coming for our blood!

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:42.240
So even if you're blind...

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:45.050
Sawa, it's not over yet.

00:20:46.070 --> 00:20:51.710
As long as even one of our 
clan survives... it won't end.

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:55.820
Then I'll stay here and die with you!

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:06.240
Is someone else there?

00:21:07.520 --> 00:21:09.600
Go, Sawa.

00:21:11.070 --> 00:21:14.980
You... should live.
